  "visual_review": [
    "All 18 captures show the locked loan copy, ordering, state, and coin and trust changes. Capture days 8, 11 and 18 use 10:00.",
    "HUD type, spacing, borders and fill use the existing native implementation.",
    "l01/l06/l07/l10/l17 use the native map geometry, outlines, scale, gate icon and separate player/place markers. The existing Make up Dhuhr control is visible. The navigation and place bars use native offsets, widths and gaps. l17 places navigation above the place bar. The master puts it inline.",
    "Story and reputation frames use the native placeholder Spice row. Native block walls, flat ground, lighting, shadows, sky and camera framing differ from the storefronts, awnings, lanterns, paving and arch in the masters.",
    "Story panels use native type, wraps, border, corner radius, opacity, padding and button widths. The l08 row fits three choices within the panel. l18 centres the insufficient-coins label vertically alongside Not this time.",
    "l04/l12/l14/l16 use the existing What people say layout. The heading, quote, source, tag, divider and town note use native type and spacing."
  ],
